id: vehicle-scanner
name: Scanner
kind: vehicle quality
slots: 1
source: Vehicles
needsCreatorSkill: knowledge 2
waits: Waits on the Item Search Adventure Maneuver.
# Its entry as the Vehicles page prints it, word for word.
text: >
  Scanner: This Vehicle has the ability to scan its surroundings and provide specific information to its Pilot.
  –Prerequisites: This Vehicle's Creator has 2+ Skill Ranks in Knowledge (Science).
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: You gain access to the Item Search Adventure Maneuver (see — Adventure Maneuvers) while you are Piloting
  this Vehicle.

